WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.428 --> 00:00:03.312
- [Narrator] This is Howard,
he's four months old.

00:00:03.312 --> 00:00:05.600
He lives in California with his family.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:06.998
Tuk is his mom.

00:00:06.998 --> 00:00:10.683
Domino is his dad, and Boo is his sister.

00:00:10.683 --> 00:00:13.033
They are pileated gibbons.

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:16.283
(lively, bouncy music)

00:00:17.258 --> 00:00:21.549
This species is found in
Thailand, Cambodia, and Laos.

00:00:21.549 --> 00:00:24.380
In the wild, they are threatened
by habitat destruction

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:26.479
and the wild animal trade.

00:00:26.479 --> 00:00:28.879
They live mostly in trees and all gibbons

00:00:28.879 --> 00:00:31.228
have strong arms and legs.

00:00:31.228 --> 00:00:33.019
The long, muscular arms help them move

00:00:33.019 --> 00:00:36.151
through the branches
with impressive speed.

00:00:36.151 --> 00:00:39.231
Romantics by nature,
pileated gibbon couples

00:00:39.231 --> 00:00:41.303
are usually monogamous, often staying

00:00:41.303 --> 00:00:43.551
with their partners for life.

00:00:43.551 --> 00:00:46.708
Gibbon couples form strong
bonds, grooming each other

00:00:46.708 --> 00:00:48.882
and hanging out in trees.

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:51.420
Both males and females are similar in size

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:54.802
and have a cooperative family dynamic.

00:00:54.802 --> 00:00:57.092
Families do everything together,

00:00:57.092 --> 00:00:58.524
and when the children are grown,

00:00:58.524 --> 00:01:01.924
they leave to create their own families.

00:01:01.924 --> 00:01:04.366
Baby gibbons learn how to
grasp their mother's hair

00:01:04.366 --> 00:01:06.627
from early on, and will
nurse for the first

00:01:06.627 --> 00:01:08.954
two years of their life.

00:01:08.954 --> 00:01:11.695
Howard hasn't started
swinging on his own yet,

00:01:11.695 --> 00:01:14.690
but he'll be ready to start learning soon.

00:01:14.690 --> 00:01:17.023
This is the pileated gibbon.

00:01:21.101 --> 00:01:23.684
(chiming note)

